{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3002_023aka", "source_sha256": "a17337c90c40e607839fba5d0128a530d518435f1b0577601c37c5e72e4f28eb", "ja": "ねーねー{$P$}ちゃん、茜ちゃん、\nどういう演技したらいいのかな？　わかんないよー！", "zh": "欸～欸～小{$P$}，小茜\n该怎么演出比较好？小茜不懂啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
