{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3202_023aka", "source_sha256": "283ef9048e78e034f77d70cf0ff4ed28628f9833b13970947eb35557c062936e", "ja": "え、やっぱり不安？　なんで？\n茜ちゃんのポテンシャルを信じるのだー！", "zh": "咦，果然还是觉得不安？为什么？\n你要相信小茜的潜力──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3300_p", "source_sha256": "61f9af5c73d6955798a96776bee5135bfd3df086696df6fefb8879c3121d5505", "ja": "役の気持ちになりきって、自然な形で演じる。\nそれが一番じゃないかな。", "zh": "深入角色的内心世界，以自然的感觉演出。\n这应该才是最好的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3301_023aka", "source_sha256": "376d9c0acc7bc898cb6e90f7b63f61ebfbb84fa35ba38ae9ca62e865c423271c", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんの説明は難しいなー。\nいいや、ちょっとカンちゃんに聞いてこよーっと！", "zh": "小{$P$}的说明真难懂～\n算了，小茜去问一下小导吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3302_p", "source_sha256": "87dac477f5f8cbe823bf5aec4dd1fc7b11bd3ba8e2bc130638b227d1084144f9", "ja": "カンちゃん……？　まさか、それは監督のことか？\nま、待て、茜！　やる気はわかるが自重しろ！", "zh": "小导……？难道是指导演吗？\n慢、慢着，茜！我明白你的干劲，但是给我收敛点啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3500_p", "source_sha256": "1d2de52a5e06d365b57b002011e3f7499c1248d2bfcf530b272e6aae0089aa77", "ja": "茜自身の個性を出していくのがいいんじゃないか。\n細かい役どころは、それほど気にしないくていい。", "zh": "只要演出茜本身的个性就行了吧？\n不需要太介意角色的典型印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3501_023aka", "source_sha256": "d72545d2d229955a5ecf24b25de7991ddd1bcddf0c93d957b0d14ccce370ee4c", "ja": "おっ、わかってるね、{$P$}ちゃん♪\n茜ちゃんは何を演じても茜ちゃんだからね！", "zh": "哦，你真懂呢，小{$P$}♪\n因为小茜不管演什么都是小茜啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3502_023aka", "source_sha256": "60c50b73529cced23db7c1f5fed3f07e7c97bb8ecd428851857f155513d08053", "ja": "黙っていてもにじみ出るカワイさ！　いやー辛いなー。\nでもそれも茜ちゃんの個性だから、しょうがないよね！", "zh": "就算不说话也会自然散发可爱气质！哎呀～真辛苦呢～\n不过那也是小茜的个性，所以也没办法呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3600_p", "source_sha256": "ce3be6ddeca4386b987a81281bd479c84c0ad7625c33f991469e24a5b605c474", "ja": "茜自身の個性を出していくのがいいんじゃないか。\n細かい役どころは、それほど気にしなくていい。", "zh": "只要演出茜本身的个性就行了吧？\n不需要太介意角色的典型印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3601_023aka", "source_sha256": "249018458e3c573df05a24c2f8e17dbe331610535df1b3089ce3885027dbff34", "ja": "そのとおり！　配役なんて気にしなーい！\n茜ちゃんのカワイさをメいっぱいアピってくるよ！", "zh": "说得没错！根本不需要在意角色──！\n小茜会尽情展示自己有多可爱的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_3602_p", "source_sha256": "8e5f1d21fec87ed22d3550024a93e145960b89c3c1121f507c5aa7a5d9713c70", "ja": "待て待て。最低限、役は気にしろよ？\n共演者の人に迷惑だし、監督にも怒られるからな。", "zh": "慢着慢着，最少可不要忘了自己的角色啊。\n否则不仅会造成同剧演员的困扰，而且还会被导演骂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
